# API Configuration — all keys optional

## Free-tier gateways
- `GOOGLE_API_KEY`     — Google Gemini
- `MISTRAL_API_KEY`    — Mistral
- `TOGETHER_API_KEY`   — Together AI
- `COHERE_API_KEY`     — Cohere
- `AIMLAPI_API_KEY`    — AIMLAPI (433 models, public API ok)
- `NOVITA_API_KEY`     — Novita (131 models, public API ok, free tier available)

## Other gateways
- `OPENROUTER_API_KEY` — OpenRouter (public API ok)
- `KILO_API_KEY`       — Kilo (public API ok)
- `SAMBANOVA_API_KEY`  — SambaNova (public API ok, 7 models)
- `GROQ_API_KEY`       — Groq
- `HUGGINGFACE_API_KEY` — HuggingFace (public API ok)

## Usage
import { getModels, clearCache, enrichModels } from 'getmodelsapi';

const models = await getModels({ free: true, exclude: 'groq' });
const enriched = await enrichModels(models);
clearCache();
